 now he&#8217;s a Ranger at the Alamo\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2016-09-10-08.13.56.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2016-09-10-08.13.56-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4429\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2016-09-10-08.13.56-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2016-09-10-08.13.56-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2016-09-10-08.13.56-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2016-09-10-08.13.56.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4429'>\n\t\t\t\tJan and Roger gave us their driveway to park in overnight in Randall, Kansas\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-05-12.32.49.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-05-12.32.49-300x169.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4430\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-05-12.32.49-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-05-12.32.49-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-05-12.32.49-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-05-12.32.49.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4430'>\n\t\t\t\tBarb, our new dear friend in Arizona winter of &#8217;16\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-11-18.48.53.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-11-18.48.53-300x169.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4431\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-11-18.48.53-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-11-18.48.53-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-11-18.48.53-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-11-18.48.53.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4431'>\n\t\t\t\tCheryl &#038; Phil, we met in AZ and had dinner together many times (including Christmas Day)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-21-18.21.20-1.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-21-18.21.20-1-300x169.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4432\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-21-18.21.20-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-21-18.21.20-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-21-18.21.20-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-21-18.21.20-1.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4432'>\n\t\t\t\tElaine and Don (I worked with Don at Xerox in Detroit in the 70&#8217;s, we bumped into them in Summerdale, AL and again in Heiskell, TN\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-22-19.09.14.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-22-19.09.14-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4433\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-22-19.09.14-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-22-19.09.14-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-22-19.09.14-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-22-19.09.14.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4433'>\n\t\t\t\tMy sister Marilynn and husband Rick, met them near Pensacola for dinner\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-07-15.55.42.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-07-15.55.42-300x169.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4434\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-07-15.55.42-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-07-15.55.42-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-07-15.55.42-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-07-15.55.42.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4434'>\n\t\t\t\tOur daughter Sara, we stop in Ohio twice a year to catch up\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-08-20.30.55.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-08-20.30.55-300x169.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4435\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-08-20.30.55-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-08-20.30.55-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-08-20.30.55-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-07-08-20.30.55.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4435'>\n\t\t\t\tOur son David enjoying a wedding with us\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/CindySteve.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/CindySteve-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4438\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/CindySteve-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/CindySteve-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/CindySteve-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/CindySteve.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4438'>\n\t\t\t\tCindy and Steve, new friends in AZ\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/KathyBarb.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/KathyBarb-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4439\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/KathyBarb-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/KathyBarb-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/KathyBarb-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/KathyBarb.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4439'>\n\t\t\t\tOur new friend Barb in AZ\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-23-20.08.03.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-23-20.08.03-300x169.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4446\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-23-20.08.03-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-23-20.08.03-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-23-20.08.03-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/2017-03-23-20.08.03.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4446'>\n\t\t\t\tMet up with Dave &#038; Robyn at Crestview, FL (I&#8217;ve known Dave since 2nd Grade)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/EdSandy.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/EdSandy-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4447\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/EdSandy-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/EdSandy-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/EdSandy-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/EdSandy.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4447'>\n\t\t\t\tMet up w\/ Ed &#038; Sandy at Jacksonville, (Ed was my 1st new friend when we moved to Redford Twp in 1961)\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/George-W.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/George-W-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4448\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/George-W-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/12\/George-W.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4448'>\n\t\t\t\tGeorge was my best buddy in Detroit back in late 50&#8217;s, we hadn&#8217;t talked since 1960 when my family moved\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The reason (or so we thought) that we embarked on our full-time RV lifestyle on Labor Day of 2016 was to fulfill our desire to travel and see as much of this beautiful country of ours that we could. We&#8217;ve seen a lot of sites since then, but there&#8217;s still so much more to go &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/12\/06\/wow-what-a-blast-friends-weve-seen-along-the-way\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">WOW! What a Blast &#8211; Friends We&#8217;ve Seen Along The Way<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[406,677,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707501,24592,554707354,554707502,24218731,554707500,554707231,11110,130],"class_list":["post-4405","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-family","category-friends","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-alabama","tag-arizona","tag-baldwin","tag-buddies","tag-family-2","tag-florida","tag-friends","tag-michigan","tag-school"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4405","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\